<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 235 days of 1996:</p>
<p>---------------------------1996------1995----Pct Chg</p>
<p> Gasoline..................7,818.....7,771......0.6</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,348.....3,181......5.2</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............840.......839......0.1</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,550.....1,485......4.4</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,546.....4,289......6.0</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,102....17,566......3.1</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,472.....6,601.....-2.0</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,540.....7,175......5.1</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......14,106....13,970......1.0</p>
</text>
